      "@type": "Product",
      "name": "Garvee Bordered Reddish Brown 10x13 Washable Area Rug, Farmhouse Neutral Low Pile Carpet, Stain Resistant Non Slip Soft Rug for Living Room Bedroom Dining Room",
      "description": "Modern Vintage Aesthetic: Intricate floral patterns in muted tones blend vintage elegance with contemporary design. Premium soft fibers ensure cloud-like comfort underfoot. Pet-Safe Low Pile: 0.4” pile resists pet claws and minimizes dirt buildup. Easy to vacuum fur/hair, ideal for households with pets. TPR Non-Slip Base: Textured backing grips floors securely, reducing tripping risks. Ensure surfaces are dry for optimal adhesion. Multi-Room Adaptability:  Fits living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, dorms, or home offices seamlessly. Machine-Wash Ready: Cold gentle cycle + air-dry flat. Reverse-roll stored rugs to eliminate fold marks within 72 hours.",
